#: ../../../install.rst:2
msgid "Install psutil"
msgstr "安装 psutil"

#: ../../../install.rst:5
msgid "Linux, Windows, macOS (wheels)"
msgstr "Linux, Windows, macOS (wheels)"

#: ../../../install.rst:7
msgid ""
"Pre-compiled wheels are distributed for these platforms, so you usually "
"won't need a C compiler. Install psutil with:"
msgstr ""
"为这些平台提供了预编译的 wheel 包，不需要 C 编译器就可以通过以下方式下载："

#: ../../../install.rst:10
msgid "pip install psutil"
msgstr "pip install psutil"

#: ../../../install.rst:14
msgid "Or with `uv <https://docs.astral.sh/uv/>`_:"
msgstr "或者通过 `uv <https://docs.astral.sh/uv/>`_:"

#: ../../../install.rst:16
msgid "uv add psutil"
msgstr "uv add psutil"

#: ../../../install.rst:20
msgid ""
"If wheels are not available for your platform or architecture, or you wish "
"to build & install psutil from sources, keep reading."
msgstr ""
"如果你的平台或系统架构不允许通过 wheels 构建，或者你想从源码构建或安装，请继"
"续阅读。"

#: ../../../install.rst:24
msgid "Compile psutil from source"
msgstr "从源码编译"

#: ../../../install.rst:27
msgid "UNIX"
msgstr "UNIX"

#: ../../../install.rst:29
msgid ""
"On all UNIX systems you can use the `install-sysdeps.sh`_ script. This will "
"install the system dependencies necessary to compile psutil from sources. "
"You can invoke this script from the Makefile as:"
msgstr ""
"`install-sysdeps.sh`_script 适用于所有的 UNIX 系统，它将会安装必要的系统依赖"
"进而从源码编译 psutil， 你可以像这样从 Makefile 调用这个脚本："

#: ../../../install.rst:33
msgid "make install-sysdeps"
msgstr "make install-sysdeps"

#: ../../../install.rst:37
msgid ""
"After system deps are installed, you can compile and install psutil with:"
msgstr "在系统依赖安装成功后，你可以编译并安装 psutil："

#: ../../../install.rst:39 ../../../install.rst:99
msgid ""
"make build\n"
"make install"
msgstr "make build"

#: ../../../install.rst:44
msgid ""
"...or this, which will fetch the latest source distribution from `PyPI`_:"
msgstr "或者通过 `PyPI` 拉取最新的源码"

#: ../../../install.rst:46 ../../../install.rst:90
msgid "pip install --no-binary :all: psutil"
msgstr "pip install --no-binary :all: psutil"

#: ../../../install.rst:51
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../../install.rst:53
msgid "Debian / Ubuntu:"
msgstr "Debian / Ubuntu"

#: ../../../install.rst:55
msgid ""
"sudo apt install gcc python3-dev\n"
"pip install --no-binary :all: psutil"
msgstr ""
"sudo apt install gcc python3-dev\n"
"pip install --no-binary :all: psutil"

#: ../../../install.rst:60
msgid "RedHat / CentOS:"
msgstr "RedHat / CentOS:"

#: ../../../install.rst:62
msgid ""
"sudo yum install gcc python3-devel\n"
"pip install --no-binary :all: psutil"
msgstr ""
"sudo yum install gcc python3-devel\n"
"pip install --no-binary :all: psutil"

#: ../../../install.rst:67
msgid "Arch:"
msgstr "Arch:"

#: ../../../install.rst:69
msgid ""
"sudo pacman -S gcc python\n"
"pip install --no-binary :all: psutil"
msgstr ""
"sudo pacman -S gcc python\n"
"pip install --no-binary :all: psutil"

#: ../../../install.rst:74
msgid "Alpine:"
msgstr "Alpine:"

#: ../../../install.rst:76
msgid ""
"sudo apk add gcc python3-dev musl-dev linux-headers\n"
"pip install --no-binary :all: psutil"
msgstr ""
"sudo apk add gcc python3-dev musl-dev linux-headers\n"
"pip install --no-binary :all: psutil"

#: ../../../install.rst:82
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../../../install.rst:84
msgid ""
"To build or install psutil from source on Windows, you need to have `Visual "
"Studio 2017`_ or later installed. For detailed instructions, see the "
"`CPython Developer Guide`_."
msgstr ""
"想要在 Windows 上通过源码构建或安装 psutil，你需要安装 `Visual Studio 2017` "
"或更新的版本，有关详细说明请参考 `CPython Developer Guide`_."

#: ../../../install.rst:87
msgid "MinGW is not supported for building psutil on Windows."
msgstr "MinGW 不支持在 Windows 上构建 psutil 。"

#: ../../../install.rst:88
msgid "To build directly from the source tarball (.tar.gz) on PYPI, run:"
msgstr "直接从 PyPI 提供的源码包 （.tar.gz）构建："

#: ../../../install.rst:94
msgid ""
"If you want to clone psutil's Git repository and build / develop locally, "
"first install `Git for Windows`_ and launch a Git Bash shell. This provides "
"a Unix-like environment where ``make`` works."
msgstr ""
"如果你想从 Git 仓库克隆 psutil 在本地构建或开发，先下载 `Git for Windows`_ 并"
"启动 Git Bash Shell 。你可以在它提供的类似于 Unix 的环境中使用 ``make`` 。"

#: ../../../install.rst:97
msgid "Once inside Git Bash, you can run the usual ``make`` commands:"
msgstr "在 Git Bash 中，你可以运行常见的 ``make`` 命令："

#: ../../../install.rst:105
msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

#: ../../../install.rst:107
msgid "Install Xcode first:"
msgstr "请先安装 Xcode"

#: ../../../install.rst:109
msgid ""
"xcode-select --install\n"
"pip install --no-binary :all: psutil"
msgstr "xcode-select --install"

#: ../../../install.rst:115
msgid "FreeBSD"
msgstr "FreeBSD"

#: ../../../install.rst:117
msgid ""
"pkg install python3 gcc\n"
"python3 -m pip install psutil"
msgstr ""
"pkg install python3 gcc\n"
"python3 -m pip install psutil"

#: ../../../install.rst:123
msgid "OpenBSD"
msgstr "OpenBSD"

#: ../../../install.rst:125
msgid ""
"export PKG_PATH=https://cdn.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/`uname -r`/packages/"
"`uname -m`/\n"
"pkg_add -v python3 gcc\n"
"pip install psutil"
msgstr ""
"export PKG_PATH=https://cdn.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/`uname -r`/packages/"
"`uname -m`/\n"
"pkg_add -v python3 gcc\n"
"pip install psutil"

#: ../../../install.rst:132
msgid "NetBSD"
msgstr "NetBSD"

#: ../../../install.rst:134
msgid "Assuming Python 3.11:"
msgstr "假定 Python 3.11:"

#: ../../../install.rst:136
msgid ""
"export PKG_PATH=\"https://ftp.netbsd.org/pub/pkgsrc/packages/NetBSD/`uname -"
"m`/`uname -r`/All\"\n"
"pkg_add -v pkgin\n"
"pkgin install python311-* gcc12-* py311-setuptools-* py311-pip-*\n"
"python3.11 -m pip install psutil"
msgstr ""
"export PKG_PATH=\"https://ftp.netbsd.org/pub/pkgsrc/packages/NetBSD/`uname -"
"m`/`uname -r`/All\"\n"
"pkg_add -v pkgin\n"
"pkgin install python311-* gcc12-* py311-setuptools-* py311-pip-*\n"
"python3.11 -m pip install psutil"

#: ../../../install.rst:144
msgid "Sun Solaris"
msgstr "Sun Solaris"

#: ../../../install.rst:146
msgid "If ``cc`` compiler is not installed create a symbolic link to ``gcc``:"
msgstr "如果``cc`` 编译器未安装，则创建 ``gcc`` 的符号链接："

#: ../../../install.rst:148
msgid "sudo ln -s /usr/bin/gcc /usr/local/bin/cc"
msgstr "sudo ln -s /usr/bin/gcc /usr/local/bin/cc"

#: ../../../install.rst:152
msgid "Install:"
msgstr "安装:"

#: ../../../install.rst:154
msgid ""
"pkg install gcc\n"
"pip install psutil"
msgstr "pkg install gcc"

#: ../../../install.rst:160
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "疑难解答"

#: ../../../install.rst:163
msgid "Install pip"
msgstr "安装 pip"

#: ../../../install.rst:165
msgid "If you don't have pip you can install it with wget:"
msgstr "如果你没有 pip，你可以用 weget 安装它："

#: ../../../install.rst:167
msgid "wget https://bootstrap.pypa.io/get-pip.py -O - | python3"
msgstr "wget https://bootstrap.pypa.io/get-pip.py -O - | python3"

#: ../../../install.rst:171
msgid "...or with curl:"
msgstr "...或者通过 curl ："

#: ../../../install.rst:173
msgid "python3 < <(curl -s https://bootstrap.pypa.io/get-pip.py)"
msgstr "python3 < <(curl -s https://bootstrap.pypa.io/get-pip.py)"

#: ../../../install.rst:177
msgid "On Windows, `download pip`_, open cmd.exe and install it with:"
msgstr "在 Windows 上，`download pip`_, 打开 cmd.exe 并通过以下内容下载："

#: ../../../install.rst:179
msgid "py get-pip.py"
msgstr "py get-pip.py"

#: ../../../install.rst:184
msgid "Permission errors (UNIX)"
msgstr "权限错误 (UNIX)"

#: ../../../install.rst:186
msgid ""
"If you want to install psutil system-wide and you bump into permission "
"errors either run as root user or prepend ``sudo``:"
msgstr ""
"如果你想为整个系统安装 psutil 并且遇到了权限错误，请先以 root 用户的身份运行"
"或添加 ``sudo`` ："

#: ../../../install.rst:189
msgid "sudo pip install psutil"
msgstr "sudo pip install psutil"
